'''Étoile minimum''' (ミニマムエトワール, ''Minimamu Etowāru'', '''Minimum Étoile''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

